    {
      "name": "Soggy and Slogging It",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>When a PC moves as part of an action, they can only move up to Very Close range. Action rolls made to move farther than Very Close range have disadvantage. Before rolling, a PC can mark a Stress to remove this disadvantage.</p><section id=\"secret-AYuhCKsgUawC3y2Z\" class=\"secret\"><p>What creatures, living or otherwise, lurk beneath the water's murky surface? Where or how do the PCs find relief from the stinking water?</p></section>",
